id=perftune
name=PerfTune v3 (unified runtime tuning)
version=v3
versionCode=3
author=opencode
description=Unified tuning: TCP bbr+fastopen=3, somaxconn=4096, swappiness=100, min_free_kbytes=16384, dirty 15/3, page-cluster=0, BFQ sched, readahead=512, KSM on, THP khugepaged relaxed, EAS uclamp fg=50 + CFS gran 1ms/1.5ms/8ms. Applied after boot storm; snapshot+rollback via /data/perftune.rollback